522
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:22,360
These are their words, not mine.

523
00:23:22,740 --> 00:23:23,600
Here's Trevor.

524
00:23:25,440 --> 00:23:27,020
Trevor said, well, I became

525
00:23:27,020 --> 00:23:28,600
