526
00:23:28,600 --> 00:23:30,960
I was on the front page of the newspaper.

527
00:23:31,600 --> 00:23:33,440
I had a brand new hot car.

528
00:23:33,680 --> 00:23:35,440
I had a smoking hot girlfriend.

529
00:23:35,700 --> 00:23:37,200
And I had the world by the horns.

530
00:23:37,200 --> 00:23:44,040
