533
00:23:50,800 --> 00:23:52,720
My girlfriend dumped me, and I

534
00:23:52,720 --> 00:23:54,640
was living in my parents' basement,

535
00:23:55,380 --> 00:23:58,000
working as an assistant manager at Radio Shack.

536
00:23:59,420 --> 00:24:01,480
So, well, Trevor, how'd you feel about that?

537
00:24:02,920 --> 00:24:04,680
Took me a couple of years to get

538
00:24:04,680 --> 00:24:06,440
the taste of failure out of my mouth.

539
00:24:06,440 --> 00:24:09,940
And I still remember it vividly every day.

